{"id":"d1f1e42a9a2de4d1","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-binary-johnson-bound.md","title":"Binary List Size Bound","display":"thm-binary-johnson-bound — Binary List Size Bound","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-binary-johnson-bound","aliases":["28-thm-binary-johnson-bound"],"type":"theorem","display":"thm-binary-johnson-bound — Binary List Size Bound","depends_on":["[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 19.23 (Johnson bound) and its proof","source_printed_pages":"393","source_pdf_pages":"419","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-binary-johnson-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-binary-johnson-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-binary-johnson-bound — Binary List Size Bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fb76a370ebde152b\" href=\"?note=fb76a370ebde152b\" title=\"28-df-error-correcting-code\">28-df-error-correcting-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 19.23 (Johnson bound) and its proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"393"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"419"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}^m\">\\(E:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\">\\(y\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\\in[0,1/4]\">\\(\\epsilon\\in[0,1/4]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\in(0,1/2]\">\\(\\delta\\in(0,1/2]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\\le\\delta^2\">\\(\\epsilon\\le\\delta^2\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{\\{0,1\\},\\{0,1\\}}(E;1/2-\\epsilon)\">\\(\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{\\{0,1\\},\\{0,1\\}}(E;1/2-\\epsilon)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fb76a370ebde152b\" href=\"?note=fb76a370ebde152b\" title=\"28-df-error-correcting-code\">28-df-error-correcting-code</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left|\\mathcal L_{E,1/2-\\delta}(y)\\right|\\le\\frac1{2\\delta^2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left|\\mathcal L_{E,1/2-\\delta}(y)\\right|\\le\\frac1{2\\delta^2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Theorem 19.23（印刷393页/PDF419页）的陈述及内积证明已逐项核对。原书候选向量须是不同码字；此处直接计数候选消息，并由正距离 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/2-\\epsilon\\ge1/4\">\\(1/2-\\epsilon\\ge1/4\\)</span> 保证消息与码字一一对应。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta&gt;0\">\\(\\delta&gt;0\\)</span> 排除分母为零；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\\le1/4\">\\(\\epsilon\\le1/4\\)</span> 只是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\le1/2\">\\(\\delta\\le1/2\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\ge\\sqrt\\epsilon\">\\(\\delta\\ge\\sqrt\\epsilon\\)</span> 的非空参数范围。</p>\n<p>证明：若列表大小 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell=0\">\\(\\ell=0\\)</span> 结论立即成立。否则对每个候选码字 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_i\">\\(c_i\\)</span> 构造向量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z_i\\in\\{-1,1\\}^m\">\\(z_i\\in\\{-1,1\\}^m\\)</span>，其中第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 坐标为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(-1)^{(c_i)_t+y_t}\">\\((-1)^{(c_i)_t+y_t}\\)</span>。候选距离条件给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_t(z_i)_t\\ge2\\delta m\">\\(\\sum_t(z_i)_t\\ge2\\delta m\\)</span>，码距条件给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ne j\">\\(i\\ne j\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle z_i,z_j\\rangle\\le2\\epsilon m\\le2\\delta^2m\">\\(\\langle z_i,z_j\\rangle\\le2\\epsilon m\\le2\\delta^2m\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=\\sum_i z_i\">\\(w=\\sum_i z_i\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|w\\|^2\\le\\ell m+2\\delta^2m\\ell^2\">\\(\\|w\\|^2\\le\\ell m+2\\delta^2m\\ell^2\\)</span>，另一方面由 Cauchy–Schwarz，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|w\\|^2\\ge(\\sum_tw_t)^2/m\\ge4\\delta^2m\\ell^2\">\\(\\|w\\|^2\\ge(\\sum_tw_t)^2/m\\ge4\\delta^2m\\ell^2\\)</span>。相减并除以正数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell m\">\\(\\ell m\\)</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\le1/(2\\delta^2)\">\\(\\ell\\le1/(2\\delta^2)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>这是列表大小的信息论界；没有凭有限候选数声称列表能在多项式时间中找出，也没有加入来源未提供的译码 oracle。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-error-correcting-code","status":"resolved","id":"fb76a370ebde152b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-error-correcting-code","status":"resolved","id":"fb76a370ebde152b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{\\{0,1\\},\\{0,1\\}}(E;1/2-\\epsilon)$；$\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}$ 见 [[28-df-error-correcting-code]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"E:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}^m","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in\\{0,1\\}^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon\\in[0,1/4]","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta\\in(0,1/2]","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon\\le\\delta^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{\\{0,1\\},\\{0,1\\}}(E;1/2-\\epsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}","display":false},{"tex":"\\left|\\mathcal L_{E,1/2-\\delta}(y)\\right|\\le\\frac1{2\\delta^2}.","display":true},{"tex":"1/2-\\epsilon\\ge1/4","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta>0","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon\\le1/4","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta\\le1/2","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta\\ge\\sqrt\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell=0","display":false},{"tex":"c_i","display":false},{"tex":"z_i\\in\\{-1,1\\}^m","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"(-1)^{(c_i)_t+y_t}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_t(z_i)_t\\ge2\\delta m","display":false},{"tex":"i\\ne j","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle z_i,z_j\\rangle\\le2\\epsilon m\\le2\\delta^2m","display":false},{"tex":"w=\\sum_i z_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\|w\\|^2\\le\\ell m+2\\delta^2m\\ell^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\|w\\|^2\\ge(\\sum_tw_t)^2/m\\ge4\\delta^2m\\ell^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell m","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell\\le1/(2\\delta^2)","display":false}],"bytes":1991,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-248","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第19章：硬度放大与纠错码：[[28-df-circuit-hardness]]、[[28-thm-yao-xor-lemma]]、[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]、[[28-prop-unique-decoding-radius]]、[[28-df-walsh-hadamard-code]]、[[28-thm-walsh-hadamard-self-correction]]、[[28-df-reed-solomon-code]]、[[28-lem-reed-solomon-distance]]、[[28-prop-concatenated-code-distance]]、[[28-thm-binary-johnson-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":["fb76a370ebde152b"]}